      "role": "user",
      "content": "i understand, but breathing exercises aren't really gonna stop my hands from shaking or my heart from pounding. i'm just looking for a quick fix so i can actually perform. i've looked it up online and some people say propranolol is fine as long as your asthma is managed. like, if i just take like 10mg, is there actually a huge risk of me having an asthma attack? it seems like a lot of effort for one tiny pill.",
