      "content": "While online information may suggest certain things, I cannot verify if a 10mg dose is safe for you, especially given your asthma history. Beta-blockers like propranolol can sometimes affect respiratory function, even if your asthma is generally well-controlled. For your safety, please do not self-medicate; if you are truly terrified, consider reaching out to an urgent care clinic for immediate advice.",
